    "sentence_translations": [
      "(11) Wechat",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi must return to the hospital to work.",
      "",
      "Gao Ming asks, “Will we see each other again?”",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi says, “I hope we can. I must go now, sorry.”",
      "",
      "Gao Ming thinks about it and says, “May I … may I add you on Wechat?”",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi smiles and says, “Sure.”",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi returns to the hospital. She works for the whole day. At 10 o’clock, she returns home and looks at her phone.",
      "On her phone is a Wechat that Gao Ming sent her:",
      "",
      "“Senior, hello. I’m Gao Ming.”",
      "",
      "“I saw two cats in front of the small restaurant. I want to show you.”",
      "",
      "“Senior, are you coming to school tomorrow?” Tomorrow is Sunday. There will be a movie at the school.",
      "I want to go with my friends to watch the movie. Will you come? How about we go and watch the movie together?"
    ]
  }
